@title Mega Man Zero (USA)
@file Megaman Zero (U).gba
@game AZCE
@chip SRAM
@status wip: the script replays to the "Watch out!!!" line of the opening; explored live to the opening stage after New Game (Ciel's rescue of Zero, "Watch out!!!", Zero in control in the ruins); the title has only NEW GAME / CONTINUE and nothing is written to SRAM until the first save at the Resistance Base, which needs the opening stage cleared, including the Golem boss. A human should record: New Game, play the opening stage and the Golem fight, at the Resistance Base save at Ciel's computer, quit after the save message. [load]: title > CONTINUE > the slot > the base.

[new]
until text "PRESS START" timeout=1500 every=10
wait 30
checkpoint title window=0
press START
until text "GAME" timeout=300 every=5
wait 30
checkpoint new_game window=0
press A
mash A until text "Watch out" timeout=9000 every=30
checkpoint watch_out window=0 compare=text
# Explored live: about 5000 more frames of A-mashing (Ciel's "......", the
# Golem reveal) hand control to Zero in the ruins.
